### Create a ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "CUST001",
  "customer_email": "john@example.com",
  "customer_name": "John Doe",
  "subject": "Cannot login to account",
  "description": "I have been trying to login for the past hour but keep getting an error message",
  "category": "account_access",
  "priority": "high"
}

### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets

### Get ticket by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets/{ticket-id}

### Update a ticket
PUT http://localhost:3000/tickets/{ticket-id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress",
  "assigned_to": "AGENT001"
}

### Delete a ticket
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tickets/{ticket-id}

### Auto-classify a ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets/{ticket-id}/auto-classify

### Filter tickets by category
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?category=account_access

### Filter tickets by priority
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?priority=high

### Filter tickets by status
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?status=new

### Filter tickets by customer ID
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?customer_id=CUST001

### Filter tickets by multiple criteria
GET http://localhost:3000/tickets?category=billing_question&priority=high

### Import tickets from CSV
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_tickets.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< C:\path\to\sample_tickets.csv
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Import tickets from JSON
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_tickets.json"
Content-Type: application/json

< C:\path\to\sample_tickets.json
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Import tickets from XML
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_tickets.xml"
Content-Type: application/xml

< C:\path\to\sample_tickets.xml
------WebKitFormBoundary--
